sitive cases</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>OR (95&#x00025; CI)<sup>a</sup></bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">VCA IgA positive</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.69 (0.15&#x02013;3.21)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.46 (0.05&#x02013;4.20)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.90 (0.15&#x02013;5.40)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">EA-D IgG positive</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">26</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.95 (0.53&#x02013;1.70)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">13</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.82 (0.41&#x02013;1.67)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">13</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.23 (0.58&#x02013;2.60)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">EA-R IgG positive</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">11</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.52 (0.24&#x02013;1.11)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">6</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.49 (0.19&#x02013;1.23)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.55 (0.19&#x02013;1.57)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">High VCA IgG<sup>b</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">60</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.72 (0.47&#x02013;1.09)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">32</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.63 (0.38&#x02013;1.05)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">28</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.83 (0.47&#x02013;1.46)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charof